# scripts/.env.release.example
#
# The current Homebrew-only release flow does not require any environment
# variables — `./scripts/release-unsigned.sh` reads everything it needs from
# Config/Version.xcconfig and produces a single DMG you upload via `gh
# release create`. This file is kept as a placeholder so contributors don't
# wonder where the secrets went.
#
# If you ever re-enable Developer ID + notarization, the only values you'd
# need are:
#
#   NOTARY_PROFILE=omjo-notary
#   SIGNING_IDENTITY="Developer ID Application: Neurix (83698ZGFJP)"
